 A later payment-cycle clarification can be recovered_issue when it acknowledges the customer's confusion or concern, explains the updated flow, maps each deduction to the salary month it covers, states any cash-payment responsibility, gives deduction and transfer dates, and explains the business reason for the setup. Use frustration_change: decreased.
 
